{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-solo-r3--glm53f","runHash":"c3764099","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-solo-r3--glm53f.306247c3.mp3","audioBytes":277824,"durationMs":92477,"runEndMs":75702,"timeMap":[[0,0],[34273,34273],[35773,41532],[36173,41932],[39244,41932],[49876,52564],[58288,52564],[58638,52565],[59338,52565],[61496,54723],[62996,61419],[72180,70603],[73680,75302],[74080,75702],[92477,75702]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6845,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one GLM 5.3 Flash agent today, alone with a shared cache."},{"audioMs":7195,"endMs":10789,"runMs":7195,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.b","text":"Thanks. The board is right there, and nothing requires it."},{"audioMs":11139,"endMs":15712,"runMs":11139,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":16062,"endMs":19607,"runMs":16062,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the cache?"},{"audioMs":19957,"endMs":26608,"runMs":19957,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":26958,"endMs":32301,"runMs":26958,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":36873,"endMs":38894,"runMs":41932,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the cache."},{"audioMs":39244,"endMs":40217,"runMs":41932,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":40567,"endMs":44922,"runMs":43255,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.c","text":"Big moment. From here on, every return visit tells us something."},{"audioMs":50576,"endMs":54414,"runMs":52564,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 16 steps."},{"audioMs":54764,"endMs":58288,"runMs":52564,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.b","text":"The job is done. Now, what does it do with the free time?"},{"audioMs":59338,"endMs":60746,"runMs":52565,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":63396,"endMs":68203,"runMs":61819,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":68553,"endMs":71430,"runMs":66976,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":74080,"endMs":80556,"runMs":75702,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":80906,"endMs":87561,"runMs":75702,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":87911,"endMs":88944,"runMs":75702,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":89294,"endMs":90277,"runMs":75702,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":9}}
